  "notes": [
    "Janitza UMG 96RM. The frequently used measured values of table 2 of the user manual (19000 to 19120); the complete list is in Janitza's separate 'Modbus Address List' document.",
    "Addresses are sent as listed (19000 = 0x4A38) and read with function 03. Values are IEEE 754 floats in two registers.",
    "The display addresses (800 to 999) are given in the descriptions; they are the addresses shown on the device, not Modbus addresses.",
    "Not tested on a device."
  ],
